<title>INDIA: India Hindustan Motor 1st half net dips.</title>
<headline>India Hindustan Motor 1st half net dips.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to end-September</p>
<p>		(in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		174.4  vs    197.0</p>
<p>    Net sales	     4,449.0  vs  4,155.5</p>
<p>    Other income	     21.4  vs     12.6</p>
<p>    Total expenditure   3,873.6  vs  3,629.2</p>
<p>    Interest		  270.7  vs    234.5</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    125.7  vs    107.4</p>
<p>    Tax			  26.0  vs	0.0</p>
<p>NOTE: Indian car maker Hindustan Motors Ltd said in a statement that its modernisation schemes for automotive divisions were in progress.</p>
<p>--  New Delhi newsroom +91-11 301 2024</p>
</text>
